# Hocuspocus document store
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

*storybook.log

# Stryker: HTML/JSON reports are build output; the incremental file is
# per-machine state (mutant ids and timings), so committing it would let a
# stale score masquerade as a fresh one.
reports/
.stryker-tmp/
stryker.log

# Measurement scratch: JSON dumps and one-off probes kept while a change is
# being verified. Never imported, never shipped, and never worth a lint error.
.scratch/

# Isolated checkouts for parallel workstreams.
.worktrees/

# The scratchpad and its last-read marker: the author's own queue between passes, so
# both are per-machine. `pnpm scratchpad` creates the file from a template on demand.
.scratchpad.md
.scratchpad-seen

# The Fumadocs site is generated from `docs/` by `scripts/sync-docs.mjs`:
# pages, frontmatter, meta.json and the copied assets are build input, not
# source. Edit `docs/` instead.
apps/docs/content/docs/
apps/docs/public/docs/
apps/docs/.source/
apps/docs/.next/
internal/
